#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "B<reload>"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-unstable fedora-rawhide
msgid "Reload \\&.netdev and \\&.network files\\&."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-unstable fedora-rawhide
msgid ""
"If a new or modified \\&.netdev file is found, then the corresponding netdev "
"is created or updated, respectively\\&. Note, if the corresponding interface "
"already exists, then some of new settings may not be applied\\&. E\\&.g\\&., "
"VLAN ID cannot be changed after the interface was created, so changing "
"[VLAN] I<Id=> will not take effect if the matching VLAN interface already "
"exists\\&. To apply such settings, the interfaces need to be removed "
"manually before reload\\&. Also note that even if a \\&.netdev file is "
"removed, B<systemd-networkd> does not remove the existing netdev "
"corresponding to the file\\&."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-unstable fedora-rawhide
msgid ""
"If a new, modified, or removed \\&.network file is found, then all "
"interfaces that matched the file are reconfigured\\&."
msgstr ""

