msgid "B<--stdin>"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-unstable fedora-rawhide
msgid ""
"When used with B<edit>, the contents of the file will be read from standard "
"input and the editor will not be launched\\&. In this mode, the old contents "
"of the file are automatically replaced\\&. This is useful to \"edit\" "
"configuration from scripts, especially so that drop-in directories are "
